Medicina Consulta Open is a clean, focused successor to the educational
Medicina Consulta projects by Martin Lofrano de Oliveira:

https://github.com/martinlofranodeoliveira/medicinaconsulta
https://github.com/martinlofranodeoliveira/medicina-consulta

The earlier Node project declared the ISC license in package.json. This
release retains that license and attribution. Its scheduling API and tests
are a new implementation. It contains no original accounts, contact forms,
passwords, SMTP settings, logs, uploaded avatars, commercial logos, stock
photos, payment forms, or Git history. The Ionic starter is not included.

Node.js is a separate runtime, distributed under its own license:
https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/main/LICENSE
